  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 8,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.648,
            0.047,
            0.846,
            0.064
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Working with Fractions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.088,
            0.848,
            0.142
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Doing this by representing the fractions using a unit square is cumbersome. Let us find the product by observing what we did in the above cases."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.143,
            0.747,
            0.161
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In each case, the whole is divided into rows and columns."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.162,
            0.847,
            0.198
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The number of rows is the denominator of the multiplicand, which is 18 in this case."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.198,
            0.621,
            0.235
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The number of columns is the denominator of the multiplier, which is 12 in this case."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.235,
            0.62,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Thus, the whole is divided into 18 × 12 equal parts."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.274,
            0.445,
            0.311
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{1}{18} \\times \\frac{1}{12} = \\frac{1}{(18 \\times 12)} = \\frac{1}{216}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.32,
            0.621,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Thus, when two fractional units are multiplied, their product is"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.634,
            0.198,
            0.865,
            0.344
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.634,
                0.198,
                0.865,
                0.344
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_8_image_8.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.375,
            0.372,
            0.645,
            0.409
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1 (product of denominators)."
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.418,
            0.37,
            0.438
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We express this as:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.432,
            0.45,
            0.564,
            0.486
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_8_equation_11.jpg",
          "content": "\\frac{1}{b} \\times \\frac{1}{d} = \\frac{1}{b \\times d}."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.492,
            0.848,
            0.614
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Find the following products. Use a unit square as a whole for representing the fractions and carrying out the operations. (a) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 2 } { 3 } \\times \\frac { 4 } { 5 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (b) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 } \\times \\frac { 2 } { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (c) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 3 } { 5 } \\times \\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (d) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{4}{6} \\times \\frac{3}{5}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.449,
            0.971,
            0.55,
            0.984
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.627,
            0.686,
            0.649
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Multiplying Numerators and Denominators"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.661,
            0.333,
            0.697
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, find "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 5 } { 1 2 } \\times \\frac { 7 } { 1 8 } ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.704,
            0.625,
            0.783
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Like the previous case, let us find the product by performing the multiplication, step by step. First, the whole is divided into 18 rows and 12 columns creating 12 × 18 equal parts."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.79,
            0.624,
            0.853
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The value we get by dividing "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 7 } { 1 8 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " into 12 equal parts is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 7 } { ( 1 2 \\times 1 8 ) }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
